{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35733862",
      "title": "Working with Navigation Links (NavLink)",
      "sourceHash": "ce791e10345c18433a00d5835d461ed4c270f63098cc405708177ba6ce53133c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.42,
          "en": "We got an Error page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.42,
          "end": 4.47,
          "en": "we got our navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.47,
          "end": 5.67,
          "en": "We got the links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 5.67,
          "end": 9,
          "en": "At the moment you might notice that we got no real feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9,
          "end": 11.34,
          "en": "when we're hovering over these links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.34,
          "end": 15,
          "en": "And you might also of course see that we can't tell",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 19.35,
          "en": "which link is currently active when we're on a page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.35,
          "end": 21.66,
          "en": "Of course we can take a look at the URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.66,
          "end": 24.75,
          "en": "and of course the page content might help us understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.75,
          "end": 28.05,
          "en": "which page this is but it's also quite common",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.05,
          "end": 30.39,
          "en": "that the currently active link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.39,
          "end": 34.44,
          "en": "that led to the page that's active is highlighted somehow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.44,
          "end": 36.57,
          "en": "And at the moment that's missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.57,
          "end": 38.28,
          "en": "Of course it's such a common behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.28,
          "end": 43.05,
          "en": "that it's quite easy to support with react-router-dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.05,
          "end": 45.09,
          "en": "For highlighting the active link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.09,
          "end": 50.09,
          "en": "we can start by going to our MainNavigation.module CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.1,
          "end": 54.93,
          "en": "and actually add maybe a hover style for the anchor tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.93,
          "end": 59.88,
          "en": "but also support an active class on the anchor element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.88,
          "end": 63.03,
          "en": "And we're targeting the anchor here instead of link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.03,
          "end": 65.91,
          "en": "because as mentioned before, this link component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.91,
          "end": 69,
          "en": "provided by react-router-dom does render",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69,
          "end": 70.983,
          "en": "a regular anchor element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.06,
          "end": 74.03999999999999,
          "en": "So here we might wanna define some styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.03999999999999,
          "end": 77.19,
          "en": "that should be active when we're hovering over a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.19,
          "end": 80.49,
          "en": "or if a link has these special active class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.49,
          "end": 82.83,
          "en": "Which, at the moment it will never have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.83,
          "end": 84.75,
          "en": "but which will add conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.75,
          "end": 88.023,
          "en": "based on whether a link is active or not soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.95,
          "end": 92.00999999999999,
          "en": "So here, to indicate if a link is active,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.00999999999999,
          "end": 94.17,
          "en": "we could for example change its color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.17,
          "end": 96.50999999999999,
          "en": "And I got a couple of CSS variables here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.50999999999999,
          "end": 98.75999999999999,
          "en": "for different colors we can use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.75999999999999,
          "end": 101.07,
          "en": "We could, for example, try this one here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.07,
          "end": 105.47999999999999,
          "en": "The primary 800 color with this CSS code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.47999999999999,
          "end": 107.16,
          "en": "And if we add this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.16,
          "end": 109.5,
          "en": "you see that as I hover over link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.5,
          "end": 112.62,
          "en": "It's highlighted slightly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.62,
          "end": 115.89,
          "en": "To make it a bit clearer to see that this link is active,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.89,
          "end": 119.34,
          "en": "we could also add text decoration underline.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.34,
          "end": 121.53,
          "en": "And now in addition to changing the color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.53,
          "end": 123.753,
          "en": "we add this underline effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.62,
          "end": 126.99,
          "en": "And I'll do this here for this video recording",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.99,
          "end": 129.33,
          "en": "since that should make it a bit easier to tell",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.33,
          "end": 130.983,
          "en": "which link is active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.12,
          "end": 134.01,
          "en": "Now at the moment it's just a hover effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.01,
          "end": 135,
          "en": "If we click on a link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135,
          "end": 138.36,
          "en": "it still doesn't stay active thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.36,
          "end": 140.973,
          "en": "But that's exactly what we'll add as a next step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.93,
          "end": 144.75,
          "en": "To support links that should show us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.75,
          "end": 148.02,
          "en": "whether they led to the currently active page or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.02,
          "end": 152.37,
          "en": "react-router-dom has an alternative to the link component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.37,
          "end": 154.293,
          "en": "the NavLink component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 155.22,
          "end": 158.19,
          "en": "Now NavLink is used just like link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.19,
          "end": 160.71,
          "en": "You can use it as a replacement for link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.71,
          "end": 163.92000000000002,
          "en": "but NavLink has one special behavior.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.92000000000002,
          "end": 167.82,
          "en": "If you add the class name prop to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.82,
          "end": 170.94,
          "en": "it's actually not the regular class name prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170.94,
          "end": 174.81,
          "en": "which takes a string, but instead it's a prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.81,
          "end": 177.06,
          "en": "that takes a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.06,
          "end": 180.75,
          "en": "And that function should return the class name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 180.75,
          "end": 185.16,
          "en": "the CSS class name that should be added to the anchor tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.16,
          "end": 189.39,
          "en": "Now that function also automatically receives an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 189.39,
          "end": 193.77,
          "en": "from which we can de-structure the isActive property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 193.77,
          "end": 197.61,
          "en": "And this object with the isActive property is provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.61,
          "end": 201.75,
          "en": "by a react-router-dom and is active as a Boolean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.75,
          "end": 205.2,
          "en": "that's true if this link is currently active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 205.2,
          "end": 208.65,
          "en": "So if it led to the currently active route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.65,
          "end": 211.05,
          "en": "or it's false if it did not lead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.05,
          "end": 212.763,
          "en": "to the currently active route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.69,
          "end": 216.15,
          "en": "So therefore here we can use is active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.15,
          "end": 219.87,
          "en": "to conditionally return CSS class a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.87,
          "end": 223.113,
          "en": "if this link is active and b, otherwise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.95,
          "end": 227.52,
          "en": "or in our case, we wanna add the active class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.52,
          "end": 230.34,
          "en": "from our imported CSS classes up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 230.34,
          "end": 234.03,
          "en": "if the link is active and otherwise return undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.03,
          "end": 236.223,
          "en": "So no class if it's not active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.93,
          "end": 241.14,
          "en": "And we'll do that for the other NavLink as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 241.14,
          "end": 245.07,
          "en": "Add the same class name prop, which takes disfunction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 245.07,
          "end": 248.13,
          "en": "which gets the isActive property on the object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.13,
          "end": 250.8,
          "en": "that's passed to the function automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 250.8,
          "end": 252.543,
          "en": "by react-router-dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 254.28,
          "end": 257.43,
          "en": "And with that you can tell that if I click on Home,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 257.43,
          "end": 258.69,
          "en": "Home is active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 258.69,
          "end": 261.04,
          "en": "And if I click on Products, Products is active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 262.618,
          "end": 264.09,
          "en": "And Home is also still active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 264.09,
          "end": 265.08299999999997,
          "en": "No white stat.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 266.49,
          "end": 270.27,
          "en": "That's the case because by default NavLink actually checks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270.27,
          "end": 273.54,
          "en": "whether the path of the currently active route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 273.54,
          "end": 277.35,
          "en": "starts with the path of one of those NavLinks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.35,
          "end": 280.40999999999997,
          "en": "And that NavLink is considered to be active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 280.40999999999997,
          "end": 282.87,
          "en": "if the currently active route starts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 282.87,
          "end": 285.093,
          "en": "with the path set on the link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 285.99,
          "end": 289.26,
          "en": "That behavior exists so that a link could be treated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 289.26,
          "end": 292.563,
          "en": "as active even if you're on some nested child route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 293.46,
          "end": 295.74,
          "en": "That's nice to have but not what we want here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 295.74,
          "end": 299.34000000000003,
          "en": "for the slash route since every route starts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 299.34000000000003,
          "end": 300.81,
          "en": "with slash in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 300.81,
          "end": 304.05,
          "en": "So this would always be active for all routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 304.05,
          "end": 307.74,
          "en": "And that's why react-router-dom also gives us another prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 307.74,
          "end": 311.37,
          "en": "we can set here and that's the end prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 311.37,
          "end": 313.71,
          "en": "which we can set to true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 313.71,
          "end": 317.25,
          "en": "but we can also just add it like this to set it to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 317.25,
          "end": 319.44,
          "en": "This indicates that this link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 319.44,
          "end": 321.42,
          "en": "should only be considered active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 321.42,
          "end": 325.5,
          "en": "if the currently active route ends with this path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 325.5,
          "end": 327.39,
          "en": "after the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 327.39,
          "end": 330.09,
          "en": "So now this link will only be considered active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 330.09,
          "end": 332.88,
          "en": "if we are on our domain slash nothing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 332.88,
          "end": 335.493,
          "en": "and not if we're on slash products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 336.36,
          "end": 339.33,
          "en": "We don't have to add end to this other link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 339.33,
          "end": 342.57,
          "en": "because we have no other routes that would start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 342.57,
          "end": 344.283,
          "en": "with slash products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 345.36,
          "end": 347.25,
          "en": "So there for now with that you see that Home",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 347.25,
          "end": 349.53,
          "en": "is now not active if we're on Products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 349.53,
          "end": 352.83,
          "en": "but we do see if we're on the Home page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 352.83,
          "end": 356.22,
          "en": "And that is some extra feature which we might wanna add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 356.22,
          "end": 358.47,
          "en": "and which is quite straightforward to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 358.47,
          "end": 360.42,
          "en": "with react-router-dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 360.42,
          "end": 362.13,
          "en": "Of course, it's totally up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 362.13,
          "end": 364.74,
          "en": "which act of styling you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 364.74,
          "end": 366.99,
          "en": "By the way, if you prefer inline styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 366.99,
          "end": 368.37,
          "en": "you can also use that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 368.37,
          "end": 373.37,
          "en": "You get the same function with isActive for inline styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 373.53,
          "end": 376.62,
          "en": "So here you could then also return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 376.62,
          "end": 378.63,
          "en": "some conditional inline style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 378.63,
          "end": 381.24,
          "en": "that depends on whether this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 381.24,
          "end": 384.48,
          "en": "or this link is currently active or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 384.48,
          "end": 386.97,
          "en": "So that's also something you could do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 386.97,
          "end": 388.35,
          "en": "I'm not going to do it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 388.35,
          "end": 391.08,
          "en": "but I wanted to mention it that for style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 391.08,
          "end": 395.253,
          "en": "this function form is also supported when using NavLink.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}